# The frontend uses the same-origin /api backend; no VITE_* credentials are needed.
# Configure local API/database settings in server/.env (see server/.env.example).
# For CMS-aware prerender, set this in the build command's process environment:
# PUBLIC_CONTENT_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8788 npm run build
# Never put SMTP, database, cookie or Turnstile secrets in VITE_* variables.
